.cre_build_tmp.*

# The live config names our archive instance. The token is the credential, not the URL, but an
# endpoint identifier still has no business in a public repository. `config.example.json` is the
# committed shape; copy it to config.staging.json and fill in the two values.
verdict/config.staging.json
verdict/config.production.json
